{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/0290024523ecb4789c285e6941e55beb.avif?t=1771723193\" width=800 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While traveling through the forest, you stumble upon a strange castle - one that you swear wasn\u2019t there a moment before. Upon entering the castle, your life changes forever, and now saddled with the responsibilities of the missing Grand Alchemist, you make it your mission to deliver potions to the people of Everwind while searching for the truth behind the whereabouts of your predecessor.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/72449b415ba07d4e8887f00215e4a9ed.avif?t=1771723193\" width=300 height=100 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover and Collect Ingredients!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make quality potions, you\u2019ll need ingredients - travel the lands with your faithful pony and gather what you need to make the best potions possible. The better the ingredients, the bigger your reward! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/1de15ed77e8ece3bbb8db413723f092b.poster.avif?t=1771723193\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/1de15ed77e8ece3bbb8db413723f092b.webm?t=1771723193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/1de15ed77e8ece3bbb8db413723f092b.mp4?t=1771723193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create and Deliver Potions!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the knowledge of the Grand Alchemist to concoct powerful potions for your customers and invest the payments into upgrades for your own alchemy shops. Keep an eye out for lost pages from the castle that you can use to create new kinds of potions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/c245c75abe82af6c2fd9f5032ea29723.poster.avif?t=1771723193\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/c245c75abe82af6c2fd9f5032ea29723.webm?t=1771723193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/c245c75abe82af6c2fd9f5032ea29723.mp4?t=1771723193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Care for your Pony &amp; Travel the World of Everwind!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lands of Everwind are vast, and to make your deliveries, you\u2019ll need some help from a pony. Each city has a pony you can buy with unique attributes that allow further exploration of the world, or you can create a strong bond with a pony, and they will take you anywhere. But don\u2019t forget that you\u2019re a team and you\u2019ll need to take good care of them to succeed - neglecting your pony could lead to some unruly behavior, such as refusing to cross bridges or stopping randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/610323529924f81bcc5d0f8490761717.poster.avif?t=1771723193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/610323529924f81bcc5d0f8490761717.webm?t=1771723193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/610323529924f81bcc5d0f8490761717.mp4?t=1771723193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy &amp; Upgrade Various Potion Shops!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making your customers happy with deliveries is just the first step. To truly restore alchemy to Everwind, you\u2019ll need to invest your hard-earned payments into your own potion shops - these will sell your creations and collect the profits while you're out exploring. Upgrade your shops to maximize their potential as you work towards recovering the Grand Alchemist\u2019s abandoned shop in the capital city of Hearthborne.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Horseshoes at the Forge!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft Horseshoes at the forge to make traveling more comfortable for your pony. Horseshoes allow your pony to go farther without needing to stop at a stable for care.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Pet Followers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock several pet followers through quests and other means. They will follow you when you're riding, walking, or when the pony is following as well.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Garden for Pony Treats!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy seeds and start gardening for Pony Treats. These treats will increase your pony's bond or restore their energy on the go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/17278c660d9ff2f89fb9dcbab11d4070.avif?t=1771723193\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go on an unforgettable journey with your Pony by your side!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create potions, gather ingredients, and care for your pony as you seek to unravel the mystery of the Grand Alchemist\u2019s disappearance. Travel the world, acquire lost knowledge, and purchase and upgrade shops to help build your presence in the lands of Everwind. Can you live up to the Grand Alchemist\u2019s legacy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/a8169c60d0433be9743fd75df5ab4b14.avif?t=1771723193\" width=300 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Happy Potion Making!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/97b13a0445b5f9aa7c6c6f7fff8ea3a5.avif?t=1771723193\" width=400 height=260 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990110?t=1771723193","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/a906aa680c4877c465750ed2d9276cf8a03685ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771723193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/4254afdd5139c2978c2fa885500fb3f335465086/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771723193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/4254afdd5139c2978c2fa885500fb3f335465086/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771723193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4321480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/0290024523ecb4789c285e6941e55beb.avif?t=1771723193\" width=800 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While traveling through the forest, you stumb