customers happy with deliveries is just the first step. To truly restore alchemy to Everwind, you\u2019ll need to invest your hard-earned payments into your own potion shops - these will sell your creations and collect the profits while you're out exploring. Upgrade your shops to maximize their potential as you work towards recovering the Grand Alchemist\u2019s abandoned shop in the capital city of Hearthborne.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Horseshoes at the Forge!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft Horseshoes at the forge to make traveling more comfortable for your pony. Horseshoes allow your pony to go farther without needing to stop at a stable for care.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Pet Followers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock several pet followers through quests and other means. They will follow you when you're riding, walking, or when the pony is following as well.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Garden for Pony Treats!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy seeds and start gardening for Pony Treats. These treats will increase your pony's bond or restore their energy on the go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/17278c660d9ff2f89fb9dcbab11d4070.avif?t=1771723193\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go on an unforgettable journey with your Pony by your side!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create potions, gather ingredients, and care for your pony as you seek to unravel the mystery of the Grand Alchemist\u2019s disappearance. Travel the world, acquire lost knowledge, and purchase and upgrade shops to help build your presence in the lands of Everwind. Can you live up to the Grand Alchemist\u2019s legacy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/a8169c60d0433be9743fd75df5ab4b14.avif?t=1771723193\" width=300 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Happy Potion Making!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/extras/97b13a0445b5f9aa7c6c6f7fff8ea3a5.avif?t=1771723193\" width=400 height=260 /></span></p>","developers":["Magicae! Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990110/dcdab93aa4cd91c4a73e18226587c90fec77cf44/header.jpg?t=1771723193","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3990110/50570668/5c468e78f5f76b69624bf222fffc95014008655f/1771539740/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771540200","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3990110/50570668/5c468e78f5f76b69624bf222fffc95014008655f/1771539740/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771540200","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3990110/50570668/5c468e78f5f76b69624bf222fffc95014008655f/1771539740/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771540200","id":257217181,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257217181/faaea7c0d0b7e4a6dbe9395ada95f15c301464c8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771540200"}],"name":"Potion Pony","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4340 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL Compatible Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1280x768 or greater screen resolution required</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</str